request.description:
Manually trigger AI risk score recomputation for a user. Runs the full AI agent pipeline.

Response 200: {
  status: 'COMPUTED',
  userId: String,
  overallRiskScore: BigDecimal,
  riskTier: String,
  confidence: BigDecimal
}
Response 500: { status: 'FAILED', userId, error: String }

Platform-wide risk tier distribution and recomputation candidates.

Response 200: {
  veryLow: long, low: long, medium: long, high: long, veryHigh: long,
  candidatesForRecomputation: int
}
